{"id":1997,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>近日，山西省教育厅正式公布 2025 年高校辅导员工作优秀案例评选结果，中北大学辅导员团队凭借扎实的育人实践与专业能力脱颖而出，共有9项案例荣获一等奖，14项案例荣获二等奖，20项案例荣获三等奖，在全省高校中展现出强劲的育人工作实力，充分彰显了学校在辅导员队伍建设与学生工作领域的突出成效。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Tnl7t4M4l4M4-8ojzNPUlM2U8lPMmUw4U8n2U47boRA7LRv0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaMYyDokyaLmffL8nfMR7bLmLiL4-4LNCZLlUsLm9ZLNWFUmW2Um7bnmQFLzVfUlUJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aMzU0MzGsMkbw62X8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/90768020A3DA4192353232F81D72882B/B2FB19F6/11AAD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"524\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Tnl7t4M4l4M4-8ojzNPUlM2U8lPMmUw4U8n2U47boRA7LRv0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaMYyDokyaLmffL8nfMR7bLmLiL4-4LNCZLlUsLm9ZLNWFUmW2Um7bnmQFLzVfUlUJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aMzU0MzGsMkbw62X8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\"></p><p>本次评选严格遵循个人申报、专家评审、结果公示等多环节流程，经过层层筛选，全省最终确定优秀案例 446 项。中北大学此次获奖案例紧密围绕学生成长核心需求，覆盖心理健康帮扶、学业发展指导、职业规划引领、突发情况应急处置等关键领域，全面体现了学校辅导员 “以学生为中心” 的工作理念，以及在不同育人场景下的实践创新能力与专业素养。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnzCtDMmL4Mz7ZLj8-8n7lDLzQ7M4vw4nzlaM7LsLlUDLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hfU1hkUYhkL4QVUzWkUznfM4rRnNliUmWVM8nkMmT2LmMFMlLDLz62ozTFMlQ2Mkbaptveo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGiMkyiLRv8gtA8pUXcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BABBCB36EA2BA4A75CFE5B2E7DB69F23/5C617F99/5FF4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnzCtDMmL4Mz7ZLj8-8n7lDLzQ7M4vw4nzlaM7LsLlUDLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hfU1hkUYhkL4QVUzWkUznfM4rRnNliUmWVM8nkMmT2LmMFMlLDLz62ozTFMlQ2Mkbaptveo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGiMkyiLRv8gtA8pUXcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TUzftkU4CiLzGbnjzrkL4U8Uzv8LRTwVLz78L4vao7-Yoz70gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPnkysMkyPLmW7LzvbMRvbMNUDM8LsLRC4MRL8L774L8WFUNUYnzAfM4rFLl74M8CJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aMzU0MzGsMkbw62X8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E1D74122D1794796D67C70634340A33B/BD2E8A75/1A37F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attac