4CsnmAkL8rFMRARn1baptveo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGiMkyiLRv8gtA8pUXcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TLRvtsn7lPMNUDLj7MkMRr2oRU4L4Vw7Mz7bLNUPLRMfMzU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyDLkhRnkhVnllDM8CsL4v8nNVVnNU8LRCsMlWVM7-YnmAFLNlPUmWkMmrFLmlsnlUJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aMzU0MzGsMkbw62X8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/360CDEEE67F7374FAEFD40675BE4B2F8/2E1B2B65/257ED\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TLRvtsn7lPMNUDLj7MkMRr2oRU4L4Vw7Mz7bLNUPLRMfMzU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyDLkhRnkhVnllDM8CsL4v8nNVVnNU8LRCsMlWVM7-YnmAFLNlPUmWkMmrFLmlsnlUJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aMzU0MzGsMkbw62X8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnR-tDLzffnRN8LjmNDozA2MRV2Ul7wanNVkLNUZMlLYLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkM1yZUYy8LmVVU8lZMmQRM467LlrfozGaLzM7Lm-bUmVFLNr7LRVknRTFLz7aM8lJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aMzU0MzGsMkbw62X8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FB68C421ECE866C77D1EA90013D229B1/2ED01BD9/1107E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnR-tDLzffnRN8LjmNDozA2MRV2Ul7wanNVkLNUZMlLYLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkM1yZUYy8LmVVU8lZMmQRM467LlrfozGaLzM7Lm-bUmVFLNr7LRVknRTFLz7aM8lJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aMzU0MzGsMkbw62X8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png\"></p><p>长期以来，中北大学始终将辅导员队伍建设作为提升育人质量的重要支撑，持续推动辅导员工作案例研究与实践创新，不断强化辅导员在学生成长成才过程中的引导作用。此次43项案例获奖，既是省教育厅对我校辅导员工作的高度认可，也为学校进一步优化学生工作体系、提升育人实效注入了强劲动力。</p><p>下一步，中北大学将以此次获奖为契机，充分发挥优秀案例的示范引领作用，通过组织专题研讨、经验分享会等形式，推动获奖成果在全校辅导员队伍中落地转化。同时，持续完善辅导员培训与发展机制，进一步提升辅导员专业化、职业化水平，为学生提供更精准、更优质的成长指导服务，全力护航学生成长成才。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"https://xsgzb.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Tnl7t4M4l4M4-8ojzNPUlM2U8lPMmUw4U8n2U47boRA7LRv0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaMYyDokyaLmffL8nfMR7bLmLiL4-4LNCZLlUsLm9ZLNWFUmW2Um7bnmQFLzVfUlUJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aMzU0MzGsMkbw62X8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1054&nid=5074&e=.png"}